        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricky Watters, Chris Berman\n- Organizations: ESPN, National Sports Media Association\n- Concepts: receiving skills, high-step running style, sportscasting awards, network popularity\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Berman became instrumental in establishing ESPN's lasting popularity during the network's formative years.\n- Chris Berman received the National Sports Media Association's \"National Sportscaster of the Year\" award six times.\n- Ricky Watters was known during his playing career for outstanding receiving skills and a distinctive high-step running style.\n- Chris Berman gave Ricky Watters the nickname Ricky \"Running\" Watters.",
